Z||000000||Call||12-30-1999||04:15 AM||||Once my friend and I were up at the local PepBoys (this is when I road my bike) and we were sitting around and at the time my friend was very fond of Fieros so he naturally spotted one in the parking lot (now that i know more about them I think it was like a 2m6) anyways, we went up to the car and were checkin it out when the owner came out and we started talking to him about how sweet of a car it was, well he got in and pulled off to the exit onto the highway, and man he just floored it and spun his tires right onto the highway and took off. It was kind of a fun event I just thought i'd share, I think it's probally only the 2nd or 3rd time i've seen a Fiero in real life.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <BR>||||reg||10
